ind":"announcement","title":"🚀Dark Sorcery Kickstarter Campaign Is Now Live!","summary":"Hello everyone!Today is a very special day for us, the Dark Sorcery Kickstarter campaign is officially live!Over the past months, we've been hard at work improving the game based on your feedback. We've added a new playable world, new enemies, bosses, spells, UI improvements, balance changes, optimization, and many other features. Seeing so many of you play the demo and share your thoughts has been incredibly motivating. Now we're taking the next step. Our Kickstarter campaign will help us conti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-15T20:11:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329255091","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4697230-1837955055361478","game_id":"steam-4697230","kind":"update","title":"Dark Sorcery Update v1.0.11 - New Spell!","summary":"A new update is out, focused on fresh content, smoother gameplay, and cleaner menus.What is newA brand-new spell, Dark Matter, has been added.Visual effects and combat feel have been improved in many fights.Pickups and on-screen damage effects now run more smoothly.Gameplay improvementsCombat timing feels more consistent.Enemy waves and drops were rebalanced for a better flow.Several spells and enemy behaviors were tuned to feel better in action.UI and quality improvementsArtifact and enchantmen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T16:01:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055361478","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4697230-1836506165566789","game_id":"steam-4697230","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes v1.0.10 - New game content!","summary":"Hello sorcerers, This update focuses on expanding content, improving gameplay consistency, and polishing the overall experience across menus, combat feedback, and localization. New ContentAdded the new Luma world to world selection, including preview art and world data. Expanded Luma with its full enemy lineup and variant art: common, mob, elite, abnormal, mini-boss, and boss. Added procedural world props (rocks and trees) to improve map variety. Added a new News panel on the main menu. Added lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T01:24:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165566789","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4697230-1834602721199366","game_id":"steam-4697230","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes v1.0.6 - Leaderboards and game balance (Free update)","summary":"This update focuses on survival pacing: smoother early-game onboarding, clearer mid-game escalation, and a more dramatic boss-to-endgame flow.Reworked enemy wave pacing from early game to the final boss for a smoother difficulty curve.Added clearer escalation moments with milestone warning messages before major threats.Improved elite and mini-boss integration so difficulty spikes feel more intentional.Leaderboards are now available in the Demo version. The Demo uses its own separate leaderboards","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T15:56:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721199366","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4697230-1834602721194875","game_id":"steam-4697230","kind":"announcement","title":"Be among the first to support Dark Sorcery","summary":"We're excited to announce that the Kickstarter pre-launch page for Dark Sorcery is now live.If you'd like to support the project and help us bring more content, characters, and features to the game, we invite you to follow the campaign before launch.Backers will have access to exclusive rewards, including digital collectibles, special artwork, behind-the-scenes content, physical rewards, and other surprises that won't be available through the regular Steam release.By following the pre-launch pag","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T21:50:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4697230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4697230":"2026-10-26T03:39:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4697230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4725740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4697230","app_id":4697230,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:47Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8cc05ad29df4890fcb7adf449bf091b2c49e4b4d231a9629a9b2d880743a1495","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Dark Sorcery는 끝없는 적 무리와 싸우고, 강력한 업그레이드를 해금하며, 파괴적인 빌드를 구축하는 다크 판타지 로그라이트입니다. 이동, 순간이동, 전략을 숙달해 점점 더 위험해지는 적의 파도를 살아남으세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Pandita Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46035330}],"developers":[{"name":"Pandita 